# BirdNest ESP32-CAM — ESP-IDF sdkconfig defaults
# Sourced by the ESP-IDF/arduino-esp32 build via PlatformIO.
# Keep this file in sync with the doc §8.2.1 (OTA_Design.md).
#
# --- Anti-bricking foundation (swarm review C-1, v0.1.3) ---
# Enables bootloader-level app rollback. The bootloader will boot the
# previous app if the freshly-installed one fails to mark itself valid
# within CONFIG_BOOTLOADER_APP_ROLLBACK_SPIFFS / OTA_DATA_PARTITION
# timeout. This is the foundation of the §8.2 layered safety story;
# the app-level confirmation in gh_ota.cpp (ghOtaConfirmHealthIfPending)
# is the second layer. Both must be active for §8.3 to hold.
CONFIG_BOOTLOADER_APP_ROLLBACK_ENABLE=y
